Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.87,0:00:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.99,0:00:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.31,0:00:26.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.49,0:00:29.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.31,0:00:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.87,0:00:40.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.73,0:00:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.09,0:00:52.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compass left behind,\Nit'll only slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.63,0:00:58.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heart will be your guide,\Nraise the sails and take the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.59,0:01:03.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That legendary place that\Nthe end of the map reveals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.93,0:01:10.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is only legendary until\Nsomeone proves it real?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.25,0:01:14.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all, through\Nall the trouble and times,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.67,0:01:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,through the heartache\Nand through the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.91,0:01:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that I will be there to stand by you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.17,0:01:24.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I know you'll stand by me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.37,0:01:28.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come aboard and bring along.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.33,0:01:30.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.43,0:01:33.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.97,0:01:35.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.15,0:01:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always room for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.79,0:01:42.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wanna be my friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.13,0:01:46.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are, we are on a cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.37,0:01:49.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.75,0:01:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come, come, bazooka!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.33,0:01:56.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.25,0:02:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're doomed. Run for your lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.27,0:02:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is everyone here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.29,0:02:10.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, buddy, check.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.89,0:02:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sound off if you think\Nyou're missing yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.07,0:02:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.09,0:02:15.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.31,0:02:16.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.69,0:02:17.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.60,0:02:20.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy didn't make it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.45,0:02:21.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not all here!
