Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.25,0:02:31.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At last, my flashy raft is finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.65,0:02:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear, I'll get you! Nooo!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.83,0:02:40.74,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fad(182,0)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\bord4.5\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(140,182,\1a&H00&)\pos(720,188)}Captain Buggy\N(Missing a Few Parts)
Dialogue: 2,0:02:38.83,0:02:40.74,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fad(182,0)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\bord0\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&HFBFBFA&\4a&HFF&\pos(720,188)}Captain Buggy\N(Missing a Few Parts)
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.25,0:02:50.38,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(478,0)\bord2\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(437,478,\1a&H00&)\fscx90\fscy90\fsp-1}The Adventures of Buggy's Crew
Dialogue: 2,0:02:46.25,0:02:50.38,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(478,0)\c&HE7E6E5&\bord0\4a&HFF&\fscx90\fscy90\fsp-1}The Adventures of Buggy's Crew
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.31,0:02:48.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That luck just makes me stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.01,0:02:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.43,0:03:02.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lunchtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.57,0:03:12.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got you, maroon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.81,0:03:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.75,0:03:23.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your time has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.11,0:03:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was just a joke!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.42,0:03:36.34,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fad(731,0)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\pos(720,710)\fscx85\fscy90\bord4.5\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(689,731,\1a&H00&)}A Big Bird
Dialogue: 2,0:03:33.42,0:03:36.34,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fad(731,0)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\pos(720,710)\fscx85\fscy90\bord0\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&HFAFAFA&\4a&HFF&}A Big Bird
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.51,0:03:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.85,0:03:55.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Closer! Closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.87,0:03:57.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My plan is perfection!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.47,0:03:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On! On! On!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.23,0:04:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.14,0:04:04.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On! On! On! Stupid boy! Ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.83,0:04:09.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hehehehe! Hehehehe! Hehehehe!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.91,0:04:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hehehehe!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.82,0:04:12.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.74,0:04:13.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh crap, you got me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.79,0:04:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell just happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.19,0:04:16.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,AAAAAAAA!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.95,0:04:19.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh! Stop it! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.27,0:04:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.71,0:04:22.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.75,0:04:25.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The end is there! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.23,0:04:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.21,0:04:41.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.79,0:04:45.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.83,0:04:47.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Says who?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.05,0:04:51.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to live, you must leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.55,0:04:57.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.57,0:04:59.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are the animals of the forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.99,0:05:02.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you touch them, you\Nwill be annihilated!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.87,0:05:05.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, these guys are flashy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.51,0:05:06.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.77,0:05:10.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I warned you not to take another step!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.37,0:05:15.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you shoot at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.03,0:05:17.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap, I missed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.87,0:05:19.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.19,0:05:21.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.35,0:05:24.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.47,0:05:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now get out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.29,0:05:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have Devil Fruit powers!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.81,0:05:32.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what if I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.39,0:05:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just a...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.05,0:05:35.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're just a...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.53,0:05:37.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.33,0:05:45.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like a jack-in-the-box or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.49,0:05:49.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, ironically, I am in\Na box, and my name is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.21,0:05:50.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.25,0:05:51.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a person, not a toy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.61,0:05:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, I will kill you if you go anywhere\Nnear my precious animals, so watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.91,0:06:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not hesitate to put you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.25,0:06:06.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you wanna fight? I admire your\Nstupidity, even if it gets you killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.51,0:06:24.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's no fair using weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.25,0:06:27.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you call this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.49,0:06:29.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heh, heh, heh, heh, heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.43,0:06:31.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say your prayers and say them fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.21,0:06:48.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, quick escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.65,0:07:10.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad for you, but I can't allow anyone\Nto live who tries to hurt these animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.79,0:07:15.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only reason anyone ever comes to this\Nisland is to take these precious animals!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.01,0:07:18.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would I care about\Nsome stupid animals?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.71,0:07:21.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? So...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.67,0:07:23.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then you're not a poacher?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.91,0:07:38.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.17,0:07:41.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's some pretty good sake,\Nif I don't say so myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.65,0:07:43.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.17,0:07:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since\NI've had a good drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.37,0:07:47.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have as much as you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.01,0:07:49.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can always make more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.95,0:07:53.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about that misunderstanding\Nearlier. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.93,0:07:55.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that's behind us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.45,0:07:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need to mention it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.01,0:07:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.27,0:08:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for helping me\Nrebuild my flashy raft.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.77,0:08:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No problem, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.25,0:08:15.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like working with my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.77,0:08:19.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll meet again someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.15,0:08:21.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.15,0:08:36.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good-bye, my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.65,0:08:38.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take care of yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.73,0:08:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.43,0:08:49.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.91,0:09:05.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I forgot to warn you about\Nthe monsters, but I know you'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.89,0:09:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, go the other way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.39,0:09:24.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's just great! Swim! Go, Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.83,0:09:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.83,0:09:29.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.27,0:09:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He looks hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.59,0:09:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.50,0:09:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:56.14,0:10:00.89,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fad(726,0)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\pos(720,710)\fscx85\fscy90\bord4.5\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(685,726,\1a&H00&)}A Mysterious Woman
Dialogue: 2,0:09:56.14,0:10:00.89,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fad(726,0)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\pos(720,710)\fscx85\fscy90\bord0\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&HF8F9F9&\4a&HFF&}A Mysterious Woman
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.81,0:10:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, she's hot. Wait for\Nme. I haven't seen a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.03,0:10:11.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In over 20 years, well\Nthat's a pirate's luck for!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.21,0:10:16.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I've ever seen it, I was worried about
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.31,0:10:22.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thanks
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.89,0:10:28.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I owe you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.25,0:10:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one I thought it was
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.89,0:10:34.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a Goner for sure it's really no big deal
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.09,0:10:38.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,buggy the pirate cloud right what's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.79,0:10:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.70,0:10:42.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just who are you, lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.45,0:10:44.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for a certain young pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.65,0:10:46.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you know
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.53,0:10:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.44,0:10:51.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.36,0:10:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.73,0:10:55.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just wait till I get my\Nhands on you! You're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.81,0:10:56.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.47,0:11:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the guy you're looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.75,0:11:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.13,0:11:03.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.65,0:11:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's why you saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.69,0:11:08.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then, What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.51,0:11:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hell yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.93,0:11:18.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We both want to kill the same stupid\Nkids, so we should work together!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.15,0:11:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.39,0:11:20.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's drink on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.01,0:11:34.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.05,0:11:40.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before he died, I hated Captain Buggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.57,0:11:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always thought he was\Ncruel and heartless.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.91,0:11:44.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now I see how hard he worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.89,0:11:47.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He really just wanted what\Nwas best for his crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.89,0:11:51.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Captain Buggy, we were able to\Npillage and plunder to all odds content.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.01,0:11:55.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if it'll be the\Nsame with another Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.95,0:11:57.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's honor our missing leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.85,0:12:00.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He deserves a flashy goodbye from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.47,0:12:04.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rest in peace, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.53,0:12:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me, your faithful number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.21,0:12:12.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cabaji, the acrobat is\Nready to take your place!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.81,0:12:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will take the helm and lead the buggy\Npirates back on the path to glory!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.25,0:12:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.16,0:12:20.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cabaji!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.03,0:12:23.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is I,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.25,0:12:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beast Tame Emoji,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.23,0:12:27.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the captain's right-hand man who should\Ntake his proper place as our leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.81,0:12:32.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always been the next in line and\Nnobody is going to take that away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.51,0:12:35.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be glad to take you\Nas my second in command!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.23,0:12:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right then looks like we'll have a\Nfight to see who will be the next captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.53,0:12:43.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just fine by me.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:49.89,0:12:51.98,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fad(358,0)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\pos(720,640)\fscx80\fscy85\bord4.5\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(316,358,\1a&H00&)}"Beast Tamer" Mohji\NFirst Mate of the Buggy Pirates
Dialogue: 2,0:12:49.89,0:12:51.98,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fad(358,0)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\pos(720,640)\fscx80\fscy85\bord0\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&HF2F2F2&\4a&HFF&}"Beast Tamer" Mohji\NFirst Mate of the Buggy Pirates
Dialogue: 1,0:12:54.69,0:12:56.65,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fad(354,0)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\pos(720,640)\fscx80\fscy85\bord4.5\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(313,354,\1a&H00&)}Cabaji "the Acrobat"\NFirst Officer of the Buggy Pirates
Dialogue: 2,0:12:54.69,0:12:56.65,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fad(354,0)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\pos(720,640)\fscx80\fscy85\bord0\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&HEAEAEA&\4a&HFF&}Cabaji "the Acrobat"\NFirst Officer of the Buggy Pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.45,0:13:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,KAMETING!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.79,0:13:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,KAMETING!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.70,0:13:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,KAMETING! KAMETING!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.62,0:13:13.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,KAMETING!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.53,0:13:14.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,KAMETING!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.44,0:13:15.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,KAMETING! KAMETING!\NKAMETING! KAMETING! KAMETING!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.49,0:13:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,KAMETING!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.40,0:13:17.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,KAMETING! KAMETING!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.32,0:13:28.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,KAMETING!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.27,0:13:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,KAMETING! KAMETING!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.19,0:13:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,KAMETING!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.10,0:13:30.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,KAMETING!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.01,0:13:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,KAMETING!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.92,0:13:32.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,KAMETING! KAMETING!\NKAMETING! KAMETING! KAMETING!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.84,0:13:33.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,KAMET We'll settle this the\Nold-fashioned way hand-to-hand combat,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.75,0:13:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I wouldn't have it any other way now\NI get to tear you apart limb from limb
Dialogue: 1,0:13:41.95,0:13:44.91,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fad(475,0)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\pos(720,710)\fscx85\fscy90\bord4.5\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(433,475,\1a&H00&)}Twelve Hours\NSince the Battle Started
Dialogue: 2,0:13:41.95,0:13:44.91,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fad(475,0)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\pos(720,710)\fscx85\fscy90\bord0\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&HFBFAFA&\4a&HFF&}Twelve Hours\NSince the Battle Started
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.09,0:13:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use. Just give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.27,0:13:51.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know you can't take it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.23,0:13:54.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't understand anything you just said
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.17,0:14:18.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ritchie!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.29,0:14:20.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The greatest captain ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.61,0:14:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Richie, Captain\NRichie, he's a driver!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.71,0:14:58.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After the loss of Captain Buggy,\NRitchie is the one who will lead us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.55,0:15:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All hail Captain Richie!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.66,0:15:14.58,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fad(727,0)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\pos(720,650)\fscx85\fscy90\bord4.5\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(685,727,\1a&H00&)}Richie\NCaptain of the Richie Pirates
Dialogue: 2,0:15:08.66,0:15:14.58,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fad(727,0)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\pos(720,650)\fscx85\fscy90\bord0\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&HFBFBFB&\4a&HFF&}Richie\NCaptain of the Richie Pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.09,0:15:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are trespassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.67,0:15:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This island belongs to the Bearclaw\Ntribe and you will be shown no mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.05,0:15:48.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.41,0:15:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We shall fight to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.13,0:16:15.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.75,0:16:24.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you find something good?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.53,0:16:31.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, that's my ship, the grand\Nflashy flagship of the Buggy Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.81,0:16:34.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But who would do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.49,0:16:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who would use such an old picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.97,0:16:39.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what did they bury?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.61,0:16:43.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, there's somebody passed out\Non the ground over there? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.69,0:16:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.39,0:16:48.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moji! Cabaji!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.47,0:16:50.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell happened to you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.23,0:16:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,C-Captain Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.49,0:16:57.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.43,0:17:01.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never leave us again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.39,0:17:04.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've gone to a camp forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.55,0:17:07.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I miss you guys so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.81,0:17:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, uh, who kicked your asses?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.41,0:17:15.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to say hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.19,0:17:20.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, I don't remember anything\Nexcept getting knocked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.83,0:17:24.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were attacked, but I\Nhave no idea who did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.49,0:17:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like your boys have been\Nintroduced to the Bearclaw tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.29,0:17:33.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We better hurry up if you\Nwant to save your crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.83,0:17:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Bearclaws are cannibals.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.79,0:17:53.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a crab in the pot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.39,0:17:54.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't eat us now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.57,0:17:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't die, Pete, myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.31,0:17:58.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll all be dry and stringy anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.79,0:17:59.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just eat this guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.05,0:18:00.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He looks tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.99,0:18:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got much more meat\Nin his bones than I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.35,0:18:04.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eat him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.26,0:18:05.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.25,0:18:06.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.97,0:18:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.03,0:18:11.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll all be over soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.37,0:18:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're the Bearclaw tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.07,0:18:16.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know how to prepare anyone\Nto taste quite delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.33,0:18:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do with these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.11,0:18:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Appetizers?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.02,0:18:26.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure those chumps\Nwould be very good to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.53,0:18:27.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give them to the dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.61,0:18:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.57,0:18:31.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it might make him throw up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.37,0:18:32.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chop, chop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.29,0:18:38.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chop, chop, chop, chop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.99,0:19:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.85,0:19:12.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jump, Flashy! Reassemble!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:42.18,0:19:45.39,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\pos(720,640)\fscx80\fscy85\bord4.5\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&}Buggy "the Clown"\NCaptain of the Buggy Pirates
Dialogue: 2,0:19:42.18,0:19:45.39,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\pos(720,640)\fscx80\fscy85\bord0\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&HEFEFEF&\4a&HFF&}Buggy "the Clown"\NCaptain of the Buggy Pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.63,0:19:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, my favorite, showtime,\NSuper Flashing Buggy Ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.71,0:20:10.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Richie!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.07,0:20:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Acrobatics! Techniques!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.71,0:20:22.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Extreme Wrath of the Steam Bash!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.11,0:20:25.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for the Beast Tape emoji!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.85,0:20:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Captain Buggy the Clown Pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.31,0:20:38.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't really think you'd\Nbe able to hurt me, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.79,0:20:43.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your tribe has done such a\Ngood job looking after my men.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.11,0:20:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me give you your reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.19,0:20:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like them, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.05,0:20:50.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're some kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.09,0:20:58.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chop-chop! Punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.65,0:21:02.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try to eat us now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.59,0:21:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.57,0:21:15.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saved us!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.41,0:21:20.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My adorable little children,\NI've missed you all so very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.03,0:21:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where have you been, Captain, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.75,0:21:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please tell us what\Nhappened to you at sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.07,0:21:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That damn Straw Hat is the\Nreason for all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.39,0:21:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise that I will make him pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.05,0:21:39.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, Captain Buggy, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.05,0:21:41.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's the pretty lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.19,0:21:46.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the woman who saved\Nmy life, and her name is...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.91,0:21:47.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.29,0:21:49.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know her name.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.43,0:21:52.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, what was your name again?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.09,0:21:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.00,0:21:59.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Buggy Pirates are back together!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.99,0:22:05.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Captain, what orders\Ndo you have for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.27,0:22:08.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To find and kill Monkey D. Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.17,0:22:31.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me, I cannot understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.17,0:22:33.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I face what I must do!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.89,0:22:36.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll say goodbye and screech your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.29,0:22:38.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've said sail alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.25,0:22:40.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But always now I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.11,0:22:41.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep you near.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.21,0:22:43.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I drift away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.11,0:22:45.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I pray you watch me as I disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.25,0:22:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I watch the sun rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.81,0:22:55.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I began to wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.95,0:22:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could be the reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.43,0:23:03.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so hot inside. No answer has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.15,0:23:06.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't get away from what's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.73,0:23:09.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.03,0:23:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me how to catch those feelings,\Nget them to come back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.87,0:23:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do what I must because\Nthey're everything I want. Will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.93,0:23:26.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pack these arms around my dreams\Nand pull them back from yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.51,0:23:31.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm holding hands with you,\NI'm sure that we can make the way.

